ent failure  to provide efficient vaccine  to provide efficient health care  and the flame appears to be growing with  a steady increase of covid19 infections  each day  and no indication that the shortage of  vaccines will be corrected soon  people will likely have more reason to  come out and call for change  scott heiler al jazeera bangkok
 

